"The application's ``argv[0]`` is ``./userprog.so``. When translating an SDK "
"simulator command ``runelf.pbn -- runner -- userprog.so``, omit the "
"separator immediately after ``runelf.pbn`` from QEMU's ``-append`` value. "
"The separator after the runner remains part of the guest command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/hexagon/sdk-programs.rst:150
msgid "The equivalent explicit semihosting configuration is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../system/hexagon/sdk-programs.rst:152
msgid ""
"qemu-system-hexagon -M V68N_1024 -display none -kernel \"$runelf\" \\\n"
"    -semihosting-config "
"\"enable=on,target=native,arg=$runelf,arg=$runner,arg=--,arg=./"
"userprog.so,arg=foo,arg=bar\""
msgstr ""
